// Tree kinds. fruitItem: what shaking drops and what you plant to grow one; fruitModel: the small
// fruit shown on the branches; sapling: item you get when digging up a young tree.
// seasons: canopy colors per season (palette chars of nature:canopy: l leaves, d shade, h highlights).
